{
  "name": "Life Link",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You create magical bond between your lifeforce and that of your Eidolon. When you or your Eidolon take damage that would reduce you to 0 hitpoints, you are reduced 1 hitpoint instead and the other takes the remainder of the damage.</p><p>The link has no effect on features that outright kill you when you are reduced to 0 hitpoints, such as the Disintegrate spell.</p>",
